2026-08-25T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-1063) 'STE enforcement runs once, in the plugin's `Stop` hook, not in three places.
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD1063  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-1063) 'Three places ran the same STE check on the same files: the script, its `npm run lint:ste` step in CI, and its `ste-lint` hook in `.pre-commit-config.yaml`.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD1063  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-1063) 'Check that the script, its `lint:ste` entry, its step in `scripts/ci.sh` and its hook in `.pre-commit-config.yaml` are gone, so the plugin's `Stop` hook is the only STE check.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD1063  1 LINE
